{"body":"# Fix WebTransport session cleanup\n\n- [ ] You've read the [Contributor Guide](https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) and [Code of Conduct](https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/main/CODE-OF-CONDUCT.md).\n- [x] You've included unit or integration tests for your change, where applicable.\n- [ ] You've included inline docs for your change, where applicable.\n- [ ] There's an open issue for the PR that you are making. If you'd like to propose a new feature or change, please open an issue to discuss the change or find an existing issue.\n\nSummary of the changes (Less than 80 chars)\n\n## Description\n\nFixes WebTransport session cleanup.\n\n- Remove a `WebTransportSession` from `Http3Connection` when it closes gracefully or aborts.\n- Snapshot sessions before connection-wide cleanup so session removal does not mutate an active enumeration.\n- Add coverage for graceful and aborted session cleanup.\n\nFixes N/A","files":[{"path":"src/Servers/Kestrel/Core/src/Internal/Http3/Http3Connection.cs","additions":39,"deletions":5,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Servers/Kestrel/Core/src/Internal/WebTransport/WebTransportSession.cs","additions":2,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Servers/Kestrel/test/InMemory.FunctionalTests/Http3/WebTransport/WebTransportSessionTests.cs","additions":65,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Servers/Kestrel/test/InMemory.FunctionalTests/Http3/WebTransport/WebTransportTestUtilities.cs","additions":30,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"}],"mergeCommit":{"oid":"03c314bbe77aa36fffe1c97e56edd8e548d3017c"},"mergedAt":"2026-10-13T17:21:50Z","number":69708,"state":"MERGED","title":"Fix WebTransport session cleanup","url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/69708"}
